BO_ 256 MixedPair: 8 FIXTURE
 SG_ SmallVolts : 0|16@1+ (0.0001,-1.5) [-1.5|0] "V" FIXTURE
 SG_ BigAmps : 16|16@1+ (0.01,-200) [-200|0] "A" FIXTURE

BO_ 257 BarePair: 8 FIXTURE
