 SG_ BigBare : 16|16@1+ (0.01,-200) [-200|0] "" FIXTURE

CM_ BO_ 256 "The owner's 0.9.0 observation, as data: a volts signal spanning -1.5..0 listed before an amps signal spanning -200..0. Pre-fix, unified mode drew BigAmps against SmallVolts's axis labels.";
CM_ BO_ 257 "The same amplitudes with no units at all — the shape that also broke per-unit mode, and the likelier one in the wild (a DBC that declares no unit).";
